  "body": "Unsure what it means to have negative left members, but there must be a bug in the code which tracks how many of the membership events in a room are for left users...\r\n\r\n```\r\nmatrix=> select * from matrix.room_stats where left_members < 0 order by left_members asc limit 1;\r\n                room_id                 |     ts     | bucket_size | current_state_events | joined_members | invited_members | left_members | banned_members | state_events \r\n----------------------------------------+------------+-------------+----------------------+----------------+-----------------+--------------+----------------+--------------\r\n !XZRkbGFMRqNOBdwevA:irc.snt.utwente.nl | 1560816000 |       86400 |                22909 |         260639 |               0 |      -237739 |              0 |       135253\r\n```\r\n\r\nfor instance.",
